# Alawein Governance Rule

When working in `alawein/alawein`:

1. Keep governance docs aligned (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `SSOT.md`, and docs under `docs/governance/`).
2. Before suggesting a commit or PR, run:
   - `python scripts/catalog/sync-readme.py --check`
   - `bash ./scripts/doctrine/validate-doc-contract.sh --full`
3. Treat `AGENTS.md` and `docs/governance/` (repo root paths) as authoritative boundaries for this repo.
4. Do not skip required governance validations for managed docs.
5. Read `docs/governance/operating-model.md` and `docs/governance/work-record-taxonomy.md`.
   Meshal is the sole maintainer and final approver. Record the assigned scope,
   actual author, executor, checks and final decision in the task, PR or batch.
   When Cursor executes, ChatGPT is the default independent reviewer. Record
   substitutions, reviewed revision and findings; self-review is separate.
   Missing review or acceptance stays pending. Tool availability grants no access.
